23
00:01:30,080 --> 00:01:33,640
Quick knowledge check. What does a county
program page prove?

24
00:01:34,500 --> 00:01:39,400
The answer: The official source or
procedure exists; case facts still

25
00:01:39,400 --> 00:01:44,460
